==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From Latin ''[[conifer]]'' (bearing cones), compound of ''[[conus]]'' (cone) and ''[[ferre]]'' (to bear)

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{context|botany|lang=en}} A plant belonging to the [[conifers]]; a [[cone]]-bearing seed [[plant]] with [[vascular]] tissue, usually a [[tree]].

====Hyponyms====
* See also [[Wikisaurus:conifer]]

====Derived terms====
* [[coniferous]]

